hadiths[102]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fatima mera tukra hain; pas jo unhein ghussa dilaye us ne mujhe ghussa dilaya."
"4189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fatima mera tukra hain; jo unhein takleef de wo mujhe takleef deta hai aur jo unhein khush kare wo mujhe khush karta hai. Aur beshak nasab qayamat ke din toot jayenge siwaye mere nasab, mere sabab aur mere susral ke."
"4190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fatima jannat walon ki auraton ki sardar hain siwaye Maryam bint Imran ke."
"4191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne maghrib ki taraf se tauba ke liye aik darwaza khola hai jis ki chaurayi sattar saal ki musafat hai; wo band nahi hoga yahan tak ke suraj us ki taraf se tuloo ho."
"4192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj Yaajooj aur Maajooj ki deewar mein se is qadr khol diya gaya, aur unhon ne apne haath se nawway ka aqad kiya."
"4193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par wahi mein waqfa aaya; phir jab main chal raha tha to maine aasman se aik aawaz suni to maine apni nazar aasman ki taraf uthayi to maine wo farishta dekha jo mere paas Ghar-e-Hira mein aaya tha, aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan takht par; to main us se darr kar ghabraya yahan tak ke zameen par gir pada. Phir main Khadija ke paas aaya aur maine kaha: Mujhe chadar urha do, mujhe chadar urha do; to mujhe chadar urhayi gayi. Phir Jibreel aaye aur farmaya: Ae chadar odhne wale, utho aur darao, aur apne Rab ki barayi bayan karo, aur apne kapre paak rakho, aur gandagi se door raho."
"4194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ahlas ka fitna bhaagna aur ladna hai; phir saraa ka fitna jis ka dhuwan mere ahle bait mein se aik shakhs ke qadmon ke neeche se hai jo dawa karega ke wo mujh se hai halanke wo mujh se nahi; mere dost to muttaqi hain. Phir log aik shakhs par sulah kar lenge jo pasli par rakhi hui raan ki tarah hoga. Phir duhayma ka fitna jo is ummat mein se kisi ko nahi chhorega magar use thappar marega; jab kaha jayega ke khatm ho gaya to barh jayega; aadmi us mein subah momin hoga aur shaam kafir, yahan tak ke log do khaimon mein bat jayenge: iman ka khaima jis mein nifaq nahi aur nifaq ka khaima jis mein iman nahi. Phir jab tum aise ho to Dajjal ka intezar karo usi din ya agle din."
"4195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka fitna us ke ghar walon, maal, jaan, aulad aur parosi mein hai; use roza, namaz, sadqa, maroof ka hukm aur munkar se mana karna mita dete hain."
"4196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat se chaar nehrein phooti hain: Furaat, Neel, Saihan aur Jaihan."
"4197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ki raan us ke satr mein se hai."
"4198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik bichhona mard ke liye, aik us ki biwi ke liye, teesra mehman ke liye aur chautha shaitan ke liye."
"4199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Makka mein tha ke mere ghar ki chhat kholi gayi aur Jibreel utre; unhon ne mera seena khola phir use Zamzam ke pani se dhoya. Phir hikmat aur iman se bhara hua sone ka tasht laye aur use mere seene mein undel diya phir use band kar diya. Phir unhon ne mera haath pakra aur mujhe pehle aasman ki taraf le gaye. Phir jab ham pehle aasman par aaye to Jibreel ne pehle aasman ke darban se kaha: Kholo. Us ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Jibreel hain. Us ne kaha: Kiya tumhare saath koi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, mere saath Muhammad hain. Us ne kaha: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Pas us ne khol diya. Phir jab ham pehle aasman se upar chadhe to aik shakhs thay jin ke dayen taraf siyah shaklein thin aur bayen taraf siyah shaklein; jab wo apne dayen taraf dekhte hanste aur jab apne bayen taraf dekhte rote. Unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed ae naik Nabi aur naik bete. Maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Adam hain; aur ye siyah shaklein jo un ke dayen aur bayen hain un ki aulad ki roohein hain; dayen wale jannat wale hain aur bayen wali siyah shaklein aag wale hain; pas jab wo apne dayen taraf dekhte hain hanste hain aur jab apne bayen taraf dekhte hain rote hain. Phir Jibreel mujhe lekar chadhe yahan tak ke doosre aasman par aaye aur us ke darban se kaha: Kholo. To us ke darban ne un se waisa hi kaha jaisa pehle aasman ke darban ne kaha tha; pas us ne khol diya. Phir jab main Idrees par guzra to unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed ae naik Nabi aur naik bhai. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Idrees hain. Phir main Musa par guzra to unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed ae naik Nabi aur naik bhai. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Musa hain. Phir main Isa par guzra to unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed ae naik Nabi aur naik bhai. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Isa bin Maryam hain. Phir main Ibrahim par guzra to unhon ne kaha: Khush-aamdeed ae naik Nabi aur naik bete. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Ibrahim hain. Phir mujhe upar le jaya gaya yahan tak ke main aisi bulandi par zahir hua jahan main qalamon ki khar-kharahat sunta tha. To Allah azza wa jal ne meri ummat par pachaas namazein farz kein. Phir main us ke saath lauta yahan tak ke Musa par guzra to Musa ne kaha: Tumhare Rab ne tumhari ummat par kiya farz kiya? Maine kaha: Un par pachaas namazein farz kein. Musa ne mujh se kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf laut jao, kyunke tumhari ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti. Pas main apne Rab ki taraf lauta to us ne aadhi kam kar di. Phir main Musa ki taraf lauta aur unhein khabar di to unhon ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf laut jao, kyunke tumhari ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti. Phir main apne Rab ki taraf lauta to us ne farmaya: Ye paanch hain aur ye pachaas hain; mere paas baat badli nahi jati. Phir main Musa ki taraf lauta to unhon ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf laut jao. Maine kaha: Mujhe apne Rab se haya aane lagi hai. Phir mujhe lekar chale yahan tak ke Sidrat-ul-Muntaha par pahunche; us ke ber Hajar ke matkon jaise aur us ke patte hathi ke kaanon jaise thay; qareeb tha ke patta is ummat ko dhaanp le. Use aise rangon ne dhaanp liya ke main nahi janta wo kiya thay. Phir mujhe jannat mein dakhil kiya gaya to us mein moti ke gumbad thay aur us ki mitti mushk thi."
"4200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ke liye chaar cheezon se faraghat pa li gayi hai: takhleeq, akhlaq, rizq aur muddat."
"4201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal har bande ke liye paanch cheezon se farigh ho chuka hai: us ki muddat, us ka rizq, us ka nishan, us ki aaraamgah aur ke wo bad-bakht hai ya khush-bakht."
"4202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah har bande ke liye paanch cheezon se farigh ho chuka hai: us ke amal, us ki muddat, us ke rizq, us ke nishan aur us ki aaraamgah se."
"4203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah chaar cheezon se farigh ho chuka hai: takhleeq, akhlaq, rizq aur muddat se."
"4204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taqdeeron aur duniya ke muamlat se farigh ho chuka aasmanon aur zameen ko paida karne se pachaas hazaar saal pehle."
"4205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bare qatl-e-aam ke din Musalmanon ka khaima aisi zameen mein hoga jise Ghouta kaha jata hai; us mein aik sheher hai jise Dimashq kaha jata hai; us din Musalmanon ki manzilon mein sab se behtar."
"4206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halal aur haram ke darmiyan farq nikah mein daf bajana aur aawaz hai."
"4207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare roze aur ahle kitab ke roze ke darmiyan farq sehri khana hai."
"4208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Quraish ko saat khaslaton se fazilat di: unhein fazilat di ke unhon ne das saal Allah ki ibadat ki jab Allah ki ibadat Quraish ke siwa koi nahi karta tha; unhein fazilat di ke unhein Haathi walon ke din madad di halanke wo mushrik thay; unhein fazilat di ke un ke baare mein Quran ki aik surat utri jis mein duniya walon mein se koi dakhil nahi hua aur wo hai: Quraish ki ulfat ke liye; aur unhein fazilat di ke un mein nabuwat, khilafat, darban hona aur pilana hai."
"4209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Quraish ko saat khaslaton se fazilat di jo un se pehle kisi ko nahi dein aur un ke baad kisi ko nahi dega: Allah ne Quraish ko fazilat di ke main un mein se hun, nabuwat un mein hai, darban hona un mein hai, pilana un mein hai, unhein Haathi walon par madad di, unhon ne das saal Allah ki ibadat ki jab un ke siwa koi us ki ibadat nahi karta tha, aur Allah ne un ke baare mein Quran ki aik surat utari jis mein un ke siwa kisi ka zikr nahi: Quraish ki ulfat ke liye."
"4210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ayesha ki fazilat auraton par aisi hai jaise sareed ki fazilat baaqi khane par."
"4211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid-e-Haram mein namaz ki fazilat us ke siwa par aik laakh namaz hai, aur meri masjid mein hazaar namaz.... ..."
"4212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aalim ki fazilat aabid par aisi hai jaise chaudi raat ke chand ki fazilat baaqi sitaron par."
"4213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aalim ki fazilat aabid par meri fazilat jaisi hai tum mein se adna par; beshak Allah azza wa jal, us ke farishte aur aasmanon aur zameen wale yahan tak ke surakh mein cheenti aur yahan tak ke machhli logon ko bhalayi sikhane wale par durood bhejte hain."
"4214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilm ki fazilat mujhe ibadat ki fazilat se zyada mehboob hai, aur tumhare deen mein behtareen cheez parhezgari hai."
"4215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz ki fazilat aadmi ki akele namaz par pachees darje hai.... ..."
"4216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab ki namaz ki fazilat aik ki namaz par pachees darje hai; aur raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte Fajr ki namaz mein jama hote hain."
"4217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki apne ghar mein namaz ki fazilat us ki namaz par jahan log use dekhte hain aisi hai jaise farz ki fazilat nafl par."
"4218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ayesha ki fazilat auraton par aisi hai jaise..... sareed ki fazilat baaqi khane par."
"4219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chaar cheezon se fazilat di gayi: mujhe aur meri ummat ko namaz mein aisa banaya gaya jaise farishte saff bandhte hain, mitti ko mere liye wuzu banaya gaya, zameen ko mere liye masjid aur paaki banaya gaya aur mere liye ghanimat halal ki gayin."
"4220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chaar cheezon se fazilat di gayi: mere liye zameen ko masjid aur paaki banaya gaya; pas meri ummat mein se jo shakhs namaz par aaye aur use na mile jis par namaz parhe to zameen ko masjid aur paaki payega; mujhe tamam logon ki taraf bheja gaya; do mahine ki musafat se mere aage chalne wale rob se meri madad ki gayi; aur mere liye ghanimat halal ki gayin."
"4221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe nabiyon par paanch cheezon se fazilat di gayi: mujhe tamam logon ki taraf bheja gaya, maine apni shafaat apni ummat ke liye bacha rakhi hai, mere saamne aik mahina aur mere peeche aik mahina rob se meri madad ki gayi, mere liye zameen ko masjid aur paaki banaya gaya aur mere liye ghanimat halal ki gayin jo mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi huin."
"4222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe nabiyon par chhe cheezon se fazilat di gayi: mujhe jame kalimaat diye gaye, rob se meri madad ki gayi, mere liye ghanimat halal ki gayin, mere liye zameen ko paaki aur masjid banaya gaya, mujhe tamam makhlooq ki taraf bheja gaya aur mujh par nabiyon ka khatima kiya gaya."
"4223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamein logon par teen cheezon se fazilat di gayi: hamari saffon ko farishton ki saffon jaisa banaya gaya, hamare liye saari zameen ko masjid banaya gaya, us ki mitti ko hamare liye paaki banaya gaya jab ham pani na payen, aur mujhe Surah Baqarah ke aakhir ki ye aayatein Arsh ke neeche khazane se di gayin jo mujh se pehle kisi Nabi ko nahi di gayin."
"4224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara fitr us din hai jis din tum fitr karo, tumhari qurbani us din hai jis din tum qurbani karo aur Arafah us din hai jis din tum Arafah karo."
"4225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara fitr us din hai jis din tum fitr karo, tumhari qurbani us din hai jis din tum qurbani karo, har Arafah mauqif hai, har Mina qurbangah hai, Makka ke har raaste qurbangah hain aur har Muzdalifa mauqif hai."
"4226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhalayi karna buri maut se bachata hai."
"4227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein se aik ummat kho gayi, maloom nahi us ka kiya bana; aur main use chuhe ke siwa kuch nahi samajhta; kiya tum nahi dekhte ke jab us ke saamne oontniyon ka doodh rakha jaye to nahi peeti aur jab us ke saamne bakriyon ka doodh rakha jaye to peeti hai."
"4228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muhaajir faqeer apne ameer logon se paanch sau saal pehle jannat mein dakhil honge."
"4229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaidi ko chhurao, bulane wale ka jawab do, bhooke ko khilao aur beemar ki ayadat karo."
"4230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: To pehle ko kis ne mutaaddi kiya?"
"4231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka khatima taaoon aur waba se hai, jo jinno mein se tumhare dushmanon ka chubhona hai, aur har cheez mein shahadat hai."
"4232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un se wafa karo aur un par Allah se madad mango."
"4233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kunwari kyun na li jis se tum khelo aur wo tum se khele, tum use hansao aur wo tumhein hansaye?"
"4234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makkhi ke aik par mein zeher hai aur doosre mein shifa; pas jab wo khane mein gire to use us mein dubo do, kyunke wo zeher ko aage karti hai aur shifa ko peeche."
"4235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba mein baarah munafiq hain; un mein se aath jannat mein dakhil nahi honge yahan tak ke oont sui ke naake mein dakhil ho jaye."
"4236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton mein far hai, bakriyon mein far hai, ladke ki taraf se aqiqa karo aur us ke sar ko khoon se na chhuo."
"4237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daanton mein paanch paanch oont hain."
"4238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ungliyon mein das das hain."
"4239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Insaan mein teen sau saath jor hain; pas us par har jor ki taraf se sadqa hai: masjid mein thook jise tum dafn karo aur cheez jo tum raaste se hatao; phir agar taqat na rakho to Chasht ki do rakatein tumhein kafi hain."
"4240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naak mein poori diyyat hai jab us ka katna poora ho: sau oont; haath mein pachaas, pair mein pachaas, aankh mein pachaas, ama mein nafs ka teesra, jaifa mein nafs ka teesra, munaqqila mein pandrah, mauziha mein paanch, daant mein paanch aur wahan ki har ungli mein das."
"4241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein aik darwaza hai jise Rayyan kaha jata hai; us ke liye rozedaron ko bulaya jayega; pas jo rozedaron mein se hoga wo us mein dakhil hoga, aur jo us mein dakhil hua kabhi pyasa nahi hoga."
"4242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein aath darwaze hain; un mein aik darwaza hai jise Rayyan kaha jata hai; us mein rozedaron ke siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga."
"4243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein khokhle moti ka khaima hai jis ki chaurayi saath meel hai; us ke har kone mein rehne wale hain jo doosron ko nahi dekhte; momin un ke darmiyan phirega."
"4244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein sau darje hain; har do darjon ke darmiyan aasman aur zameen jitna faasla hai; Firdous sab se uncha darja hai, usi se jannat ki chaaron nehrein phootti hain aur us ke upar Arsh hai; pas jab Allah se mango to Firdous mango."
"4245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein sau darje hain; har do darjon ke darmiyan sau saal ka faasla hai."
"4246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein wo hai jo na aankh ne dekha, na kaan ne suna aur na insaan ke dil mein khayal aaya."
"4247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kalonji mein maut ke siwa har beemari se shifa hai."
"4248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pachhne lagwane mein shifa hai."
"4249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makkhi mein us ke aik par mein beemari hai aur doosre mein shifa; pas jab wo bartan mein gire to use dubo do; us ki shifa us ki beemari ko door kar degi."
"4250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dafeene mein panchwan hissa hai."
"4251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bijju mein mendha hai."
"4252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shehed mein har das mashkon mein aik mashk hai."
"4253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ladke mein aqiqa hai; pas us ki taraf se khoon bahao aur us se takleef door karo."
"4254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Garam jigar mein ajr hai."
"4255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Munafiq mein teen khaslatein hain: jab baat kare jhoot bole, jab wada kare khilaf-warzi kare aur jab amanat supurd ki jaye khayanat kare."
"4256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haddi zahir karne wale zakhmon mein paanch paanch oont hain."
"4257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein dhansna, surat badalna aur pathraao hoga."
"4258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein sattais jhoote aur dajjal honge; un mein chaar auratein; aur main nabiyon ka khatima hun, mere baad koi Nabi nahi."
"4259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saqeef mein jhoota aur khun-rez hoga."
"4260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tees gaayon mein aik tabe ya tabea hai aur chalis gaayon mein aik musinna hai."
"4261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch oonton mein aik bakri hai, das mein do bakriyan, pandrah mein teen bakriyan, bees mein chaar bakriyan aur pachees mein aadh saal se do saal ki oontni paintis tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein do se teen saal ki oontni hai paintalis tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein chaar se paanch saal ki oontni hai saath tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein paanch saal ki oontni hai pichhattar tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein do laboon wali betiyan hain nabbe tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein do hiqqa hain aik sau bees tak. Phir agar oont is se zyada hon to har pachaas mein aik hiqqa aur har chalis mein laboon ki beti hai. Phir agar aik sau ikkees hon to us mein laboon ki teen betiyan hain jab tak aik sau untees tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau tees hon to us mein laboon ki do betiyan aur aik hiqqa hai jab tak aik sau untalees tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau chalis hon to us mein do hiqqe aur laboon ki aik beti hai jab tak aik sau unchas tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau pachaas hon to us mein teen hiqqe hain jab tak aik sau unsath tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau saath hon to us mein laboon ki chaar betiyan hain jab tak aik sau unhattar tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau sattar hon to us mein laboon ki teen betiyan aur aik hiqqa hai jab tak aik sau unassi tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau assi hon to us mein do hiqqe aur laboon ki do betiyan hain jab tak aik sau nawasi tak pahunche; phir agar aik sau nabbe hon to us mein teen hiqqe aur laboon ki aik beti hai jab tak aik sau ninyanwe tak pahunche; phir agar do sau hon to us mein chaar hiqqe ya laboon ki paanch betiyan hain; umron mein se jo mil jaye li jayegi. Aur charne wali bakriyon mein har chalis bakriyon mein aik bakri hai aik sau bees tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to do bakriyan hain do sau tak; phir agar do sau se zyada ho jaye to us mein teen hain teen sau tak; phir agar bakriyan is se zyada hon to har sau mein aik bakri hai; us mein kuch nahi yahan tak ke sau tak pahunche. Jami hui ko alag na kiya jaye aur alag ko jama na kiya jaye sadqe ke darr se; aur jo do shareekon ki hon wo barabari se aapas mein lautayen ge; aur sadqe mein burhi, aeb-daar bakri aur bakron ka bakra na liya jaye siwaye is ke ke sadqa lene wala chahe."
"4262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaliya ki ajwa mein, subah ke awwal hisse mein, munh nehaar har jadu ya zeher se shifa hai."
"4263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har garam jigar mein ajr hai."
"4264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har do rakaaton mein tahiyyat hai."
"4265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Charne wale oonton mein chalis mein laboon ki beti hai; oont us ke hisab se alag na kiye jayen; jo use sawab ki niyyat se ada kare us ke liye us ka ajr hai; aur jo use roke to ham use lenge aur us ke maal ka aadha; ye hamare Rab azza wa jal ke faisalon mein se aik faisla hai; us mein Muhammad ke liye kuch nahi na Aal-e-Muhammad ke liye."
"4266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ke charne wale rewar mein far hai jise tumhara rewar chugaye yahan tak ke jab wo hajiyon ke liye taiyar ho jaye to use zibah karo aur us ka gosht musafir par sadqa karo; kyunke yehi behtar hai."
"4267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke har daur mein aage barhne wale honge."
"4268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaban ki pandrahwin raat mein Allah zameen walon ko bakhsh deta hai siwaye mushrik ya keena rakhne wale ke."
"4269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pachees se kam oonton mein har paanch mein aik bakri hai; phir jab pachees tak pahunche to us mein makhaz ki beti hai paintis tak; aur agar makhaz ki beti na ho to laboon ka nar beta. Phir agar chhattis tak pahunche to us mein laboon ki beti hai paintalis tak; phir agar chhiyalis tak pahunche to us mein oont se milne wali hiqqa hai saath tak; phir agar iksath tak pahunche to us mein jaza hai pichhattar tak; phir agar chhihattar tak pahunche to us mein laboon ki do betiyan hain nabbe tak; phir agar ikyanwe tak pahunche to us mein oont se milne wali do hiqqe hain aik sau bees tak. Phir agar aik sau bees se zyada ho jaye to har chalis mein laboon ki beti aur har pachaas mein hiqqa hai. Phir jab sadqe ke faraiz mein oonton ki umrein mukhtalif hon to jis par jaza ka sadqa pahunche aur us ke paas jaza na ho aur us ke paas hiqqa ho to us se qabool ki jayegi aur us ke saath do bakriyan dega agar us ke liye aasan hon ya bees dirham. Aur jis par hiqqa ka sadqa pahunche aur us ke paas jaza ke siwa kuch na ho to us se qabool ki jayegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega. Aur jis par hiqqa ka sadqa pahunche aur us ke paas laboon ki beti ka sadqa na ho aur us ke paas hiqqa ke siwa kuch na ho to us se qabool ki jayegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega. Aur jis par laboon ki beti ka sadqa pahunche aur us ke paas laboon ki beti na ho aur us ke paas makhaz ki beti ho to us se qabool ki jayegi aur us ke saath do bakriyan dega agar us ke liye aasan hon ya bees dirham. Aur jis ka sadqa makhaz ki beti tak pahunche aur us ke paas laboon ke nar bete ke siwa kuch na ho to us se qabool kiya jayega aur us ke saath kuch nahi. Aur jis ke paas chaar oonton ke siwa kuch na ho to us mein kuch nahi siwaye is ke ke us ka maalik chahe. Aur bakriyon ke sadqe mein un ke charne wale rewar mein jab chalis hon to us mein aik bakri hai aik sau bees tak; phir agar zyada ho jaye to us mein do bakriyan hain do sau tak; phir agar aik zyada ho jaye to us mein teen bakriyan hain teen sau tak; phir agar zyada ho jaye to har sau mein aik bakri. Aur sadqe mein burhi, aeb-daar aur bakra na liya jaye siwaye is ke ke sadqa lene wala chahe; aur alag ko jama na kiya jaye aur jami ko alag na kiya jaye sadqe ke darr se; aur jo do shareekon ki hon wo aapas mein barabari se lautayen ge. Aur jab aadmi ka charne wala rewar chalis bakriyon se aik bakri kam ho to us mein kuch nahi siwaye is ke ke us ka maalik chahe. Aur chandi mein chaliswan hissa hai; phir agar maal aik sau nabbe dirham ke siwa kuch na ho to us mein kuch nahi siwaye is ke ke us ka maalik chahe."
"4270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ko aasman, nehron aur chashmon ne sairab kiya ya jo barani ho us mein daswan hissa hai; aur jis ko oont ya dol se sairab kiya gaya us mein beeswan hissa hai."
"4271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ko aasman, nehron aur chashmon ne sairab kiya us mein daswan hissa hai; aur jis ko saqiya ne sairab kiya us mein beeswan hissa hai."
"4272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ko aasman aur chashmon ne sairab kiya us mein daswan hissa hai; aur jis ko dol se sairab kiya gaya us mein beeswan hissa hai."
"4273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat mein dhansna, surat badalna aur pathraao hoga jab gaane waliyan, baaje zahir hon aur sharab pi jaye."
"4274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat mein dhansna, surat badalna aur pathraao hoga taqdeer walon mein."
"4275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un donon mein jihad karo, yani walidain."
"4276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taaoon se bhaagne wala larayi se bhaagne wale ki tarah hai, aur us mein sabr karne wala larayi mein sabr karne wale ki tarah hai."
"4277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taaoon se bhaagne wala larayi se bhaagne wale ki tarah hai, aur jo us mein sabr kare us ke liye shaheed ka ajr hai."
"4278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr do hain: rahi wo Fajr jo bheriye ki dum jaisi ho to wo namaz halal nahi karti na khana haram karti hai; aur rahi wo Fajr jo ufuq mein lambi phel jaye to wo namaz halal karti hai aur khana haram karti hai."
"4279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr do hain: aik Fajr jis mein khana haram hota hai aur namaz halal hoti hai, aur aik Fajr jis mein namaz haram hoti hai aur khana halal hota hai."
"4280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raan satr hai."
"4281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fakhr aur takabbur oont walon mein hai, aur sukoon aur waqar bakri walon mein hai."
"4282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taaoon se bhaagna larayi se bhaagne ki tarah hai."
"4283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Firdous jannat ka teela hai, sab se buland aur darmiyani; aur usi se jannat ki nehrein phootti hain."
"4284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Far haq hai; aur agar tum use chhoro yahan tak ke wo aik saal ka khubsurat makhaz ya laboon ka beta ban jaye aur use bewa ko do ya Allah ki raah mein us par sawari do to behtar hai is se ke use zibah karo aur us ka gosht us ki oon se chipak jaye, apna bartan ulta karo aur apni oontni ko yateem karo."
"4285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chandi chandi ke badle, sona sone ke badle, jau jau ke badle aur gehun gehun ke badle barabar barabar."
"4286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitr us din hai jis din tum fitr karo aur qurbani us din hai jis din tum qurbani karo."
"4287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitr us din hai jis din log fitr karein aur qurbani us din hai jis din log qurbani karein."
"4288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitrat nakhun katna, moonchh lena aur naaf ke neeche ke baal mundna hai."
"4289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fiqh Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai."
